## Interface: 50504
## Title: |cff00e5ffSeviaths|rUsefulTools
## Notes: Glowing farm spots and rare spawns on the world map for in-demand creature loot (cloth, leather, elements, BoE gear, mounts, pets), plus mining/herbalism best zones, dungeon/raid mounts and hunter tames with AH prices and Wowhead links. Classic to Mists of Pandaria (Mists of Pandaria Classic edition). Includes the Codex, Dungeons & Raids and Guild Helper.
